<div class="fg-users">
  <section class="fg-hero">
    <div class="fg-shield"><i class="fa-solid fa-users-gear"></i></div>
    <div><h2>Utilisateurs du monde</h2><p>Créez les comptes Foundry et gérez leur rôle ou leur mot de passe.</p></div>
  </section>

  <fieldset class="fg-fieldset fg-create-user">
    <legend><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Nouveau profil</legend>
    <div class="fg-user-form-grid">
      <label><span>Nom</span><input type="text" name="newName" placeholder="Nom du joueur" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label><span>Rôle</span><select name="newRole">{{#each roles}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
      <label><span>Mot de passe</span><input type="password" name="newPassword" placeholder="Mot de passe" autocomplete="new-password"></label>
      <label><span>Confirmation</span><input type="password" name="newPasswordConfirm" placeholder="Confirmer" autocomplete="new-password"></label>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="fg-primary" data-action="create-user"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Créer le profil</button>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="fg-users-toolbar">
    <label class="fg-user-search-wrap"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i><input type="search" class="fg-managed-user-search" placeholder="Rechercher un utilisateur…" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <span class="fg-user-total">{{users.length}} utilisateur{{#unless singleUser}}s{{/unless}}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="fg-managed-users">
    {{#each users}}
    <article class="fg-managed-user" data-user-id="{{id}}" data-user-name="{{name}}">
      <header><span class="fg-user-main"><span class="fg-user-color" style="--fg-user-color: {{color}}"></span><span><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{roleLabel}}{{#if active}} · connecté{{/if}}{{#if isGuardianAdmin}} · Admin Guardian{{/if}}</small></span></span>{{#if isSelf}}<span class="fg-badge">Vous</span>{{/if}}</header>
      <div class="fg-user-form-grid fg-edit-grid">
        <label><span>Nom</span><input type="text" name="name" value="{{name}}" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label><span>Rôle</span><select name="role">{{#each roles}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
        <label class="fg-password-field"><span>Nouveau mot de passe</span><input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Laisser vide pour conserver" autocomplete="new-password"></label>
      </div>
      <footer class="fg-user-actions"><button type="button" data-action="save-user"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Enregistrer</button><button type="button" class="fg-danger" data-action="delete-user" {{#if isSelf}}disabled{{/if}}><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i> Supprimer</button></footer>
    </article>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  <p class="fg-empty-search" hidden>Aucun utilisateur ne correspond à cette recherche.</p>

  <div class="fg-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i><p>Les mots de passe existants ne sont jamais affichés. Saisissez uniquement un nouveau mot de passe lorsque vous souhaitez le remplacer.</p></div>
</div>
